d **drops in world** picker + refresh\n+ Added **auto claim daily**\n+ Added **skip tutorial**\n+ Added **auto starter pack**\n\n---\n\n## Gem Gacha\n+ Added **auto buy gem gacha** (silver rolls)\n+ Added **roll once** button\n+ Added **roll delay**\n+ Added **silver reserve** (stop when low)\n\n---\n\n## Selling & Loadout\n+ Added **auto sell**\n+ Added **item types to sell** filter\n+ Added **minimum sell rarity**\n+ Added **auto quick buff**\n+ Added **auto quick heal**\n+ Added **auto equip sword**\n\n---\n\n## Combat\n+ Added **staff aim**\n+ Added **staff aim target** (mob / player)\n+ Added **kill** (insta-kill owned mobs)\n+ Added **no stun**\n+ Added **mob attach**\n+ Added **attach position** (top / behind / below)\n+ Added **attach distance**\n+ Added **attach range**\n+ Added **auto ability spam**\n+ Added **ability slot** picker (R / T / V / Y / U)\n+ Added **infinite stamina**\n\n---\n\n## Weave (Parry)\n+ Added **auto weave** (auto parry)\n+ Added **weave builder** (animation logger + timing builder)\n+ Added **open builder window**\n\n---\n\n## ESP / Visuals\n\n### Player ESP\n+ Added **player ESP** (with keybind)\n+ Added show name / distance / health / prestige\n+ Added **health bar** + **stamina bar**\n+ Added **box** (with color)\n+ Added **tracers** (with color)\n+ Added **proximity arrows**\n+ Added max distance + text size\n\n### Mob ESP\n+ Added **mob ESP**\n+ Added show name / distance / health\n+ Added **health bar**\n+ Added **box** + **tracers** + **proximity arrows**\n+ Added max distance + text size\n\n### World ESP\n+ Added **obelisk ESP**\n+ Added **campfire ESP**\n+ Added **chest ESP**\n+ Added **trinket ESP**\n+ Added **NPC ESP**\n+ Added **quest marker ESP**\n+ Added **silver ESP**\n+ Added show distance on world ESP\n\n### Drops ESP\n+ Added **drops ESP**\n+ Added per-rarity toggles (common → enhanced)\n+ Added **rarity colors**\n+ Added **custom rarity colors**\n+ Added max distance\n\n---\n\n#","tags":[],"discord":"https://disco